0..74 Comment "// Implicit parameters: the telescope `[a : Type]` after a function\'s name"
75..144 Comment "// binds parameters a use supplies by name in the instantiation slot,"
145..216 Comment "// `same[.a = Integer](3)`, in any order. The implicit and the explicit"
217..292 Comment "// parameters merge into one telescope, each after every parameter its type"
293..365 Comment "// names, ties kept in the written order; which ones are implicit is the"
366..445 Comment "// declaration\'s metadata, so the declared type is the one the function written"
446..523 Comment "// with every parameter explicit, in the merged order, has. A call that omits"
524..598 Comment "// its implicits has each one solved from its arguments and the type it is"
599..678 Comment "// checked against. The checker solves a call in a declared type where the type"
679..688 Comment "// forms."
689..765 Comment "// What refuses is in `../pathological/classifier/implicit-telescope.gandr`."
766..768 Comment "//"
769..783 Comment "// - see: #315"
784..799 Comment "// - see: #1216"
800..832 Comment "// - see: #1498 — `identityAt`"
833..863 Comment "// - see: #1188 — `twiceRun`"
864..896 Comment "// - see: #5026 — `sameSigned`"
